MacBridge Go is an independently written implementation of the public feature
contract of alexanderradahl/mac-developer-bridge, reference commit:
fea70d1a3c5524164f2159f6063ba685fef91324
https://github.com/alexanderradahl/mac-developer-bridge

The tool descriptions and JSON Schema data in internal/core/tools.json are
derived from that MIT-licensed project's public tools/list response. Its
JavaScript server, Perl PTY helper, native host, browser extension code and
Swift menu implementation are not incorporated as runtime implementations.

